#: ../../src/prepare.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_prepare_t` --- Prepare handle"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_prepare_t` —— Prepare 句柄"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:7
msgid ""
"Prepare handles will run the given callback once per loop iteration, "
"right before polling for i/o."
msgstr ""
"Prepare 句柄会在每轮循环迭代中运行给定的回调一次，恰好在轮询 I/O 之前。"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:12
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:16
msgid "Prepare handle type."
msgstr "Prepare 句柄类型。"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:20
msgid "Type definition for callback passed to :c:func:`uv_prepare_start`."
msgstr "传递给 :c:func:`uv_prepare_start` 的回调的类型定义。"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:24
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:26
msgid "N/A"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:28
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:32
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:36
msgid "Initialize the handle. This function always succeeds."
msgstr "初始化句柄。此函数总是成功。"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:38 ../../src/prepare.rst:52
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:42
msgid ""
"Start the handle with the given callback. This function always succeeds, "
"except when `cb` is `NULL`."
msgstr "以给定的回调启动句柄。此函数总是成功，除非 `cb` 为 `NULL`。"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:45
msgid "0 on success, or `UV_EINVAL` when `cb == NULL`."
msgstr "成功时为 0，否则为 `UV_EINVAL` （`cb == NULL` 时）。"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:49
msgid ""
"Stop the handle, the callback will no longer be called. This function "
"always succeeds."
msgstr "停止该句柄，回调将不再被调用。此函数总是成功。"

#: ../../src/prepare.rst:54
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"
